WEBVTT

00:00:07.813 --> 00:00:11.154
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> He’s beautiful. Is he a fox terrier?

00:00:11.471 --> 00:00:13.367
Sorry, he or she?

00:00:13.367 --> 00:00:16.929
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> She. Yes, she’s a fox terrier.

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:18.083
Her name’s Dolly.

00:00:18.544 --> 00:00:19.568
And your dog?

00:00:19.965 --> 00:00:21.185
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> He’s a Labrador.

00:00:21.502 --> 00:00:22.534
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> What’s his name?

00:00:22.882 --> 00:00:23.445
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> Barry.

00:00:23.859 --> 00:00:25.128
Barry, come here!

00:00:26.615 --> 00:00:27.961
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> Dolly. Here.

00:00:29.331 --> 00:00:30.387
Stop it.

00:00:30.659 --> 00:00:32.259
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> I think Barry likes her.

00:00:32.275 --> 00:00:34.783
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> Yes! Sorry, I’m Dave.

00:00:35.026 --> 00:00:35.923
What’s your name?

00:00:36.113 --> 00:00:37.423
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> Becca. Hi.

00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:39.135
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> Nice to meet you, Becca!

00:00:39.516 --> 00:00:40.688
How old is Barry?

00:00:40.854 --> 00:00:42.677
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> Uh… He’s, uh, two.

00:00:43.008 --> 00:00:43.868
And Dolly?

00:00:44.016 --> 00:00:45.373
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> Uh… The same.

00:00:46.453 --> 00:00:48.520
Hey, Dolly! Come back!